{
    "note": "grok 压测剧本：每条都是 run_terminal_command 工具调用（内容全为只读轻量命令），配 --exhausted loop 让 grok 持续多轮工作。每完成一次工具调用消耗一条，循环录制。工具名与形状按 grok 0.2.120 实测（tap 抓请求体得到）：名字是**全称** run_terminal_command——源码里 \"run_terminal_command\" | \"run_terminal_cmd\" | \"bash\" 那组只是渲染用的别名，写成 run_terminal_cmd 会被当成未知工具（tool result: Tool not found: run_terminal_cmd），且 required = [\"command\", \"description\"]，description 必填。实测 grok 的一次 prompt 只消费「工具轮次 + 一条收尾」，没有 peri 那样的预测请求。节奏（delayMs/chunkDelayMs/chunkSize）刻意压小，让 mock 的等待不成为瓶颈，测到的 CPU 主要来自 harness 自身的流解析与工具调度。",
    "defaults": {
        "delayMs": 10,
        "chunkDelayMs": 1,
        "chunkSize": 4
    },
    "responses": [
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "先看一眼当前目录里有什么。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_grok_ls",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "run_terminal_command",
                            "arguments": { "command": "ls", "description": "列出当前目录内容" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "再打印一行标记，确认工具链路是通的。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_grok_echo",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "run_terminal_command",
                            "arguments": { "command": "echo llm-mock-perf-tick", "description": "打印压测标记" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "接下来确认一下工作目录的绝对路径，这一步的文本刻意写长一点，让 SSE 流多切几片，好让 harness 的流式解析有稳定的负载，而不是每次都只处理两三个 chunk 就结束。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_grok_pwd",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "run_terminal_command",
                            "arguments": { "command": "pwd", "description": "打印工作目录绝对路径" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "最后看一眼带属性的目录列表。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_grok_ls_la",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "run_terminal_command",
                            "arguments": { "command": "ls -la", "description": "列出目录详情" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        }
    ]
}
